Regression: Every emitted row is ANSI-encoded twice and one copy thrown away.
  About 2% more work per keystroke, a few times the 0.5% reduction tolerance:
  the smallest work regression here.
Expect-worse: table.keystroke.reductions table.keyframe.reductions flex.keyframe.reductions

